# Import wizard up to the dry run on test, then declines the installation (nothing is written to the stand).
# Needs an archive from export-map-save.keys in the same settings folder (archives\ is listed newest first).
Down                  # main menu: Import
Enter
wait:target stand
Enter                 # test (last target, first in the list)
wait:archive list
Enter                 # newest archive
wait:preview
Enter                 # Continue
wait:options
Enter                 # no options
Enter                 # default work dir
wait:dry run plan
Enter                 # "Install into test?" -> default No
wait:main menu
Down
Down                  # Restore
Enter
Enter                 # test
wait:work dirs (none recorded: type a path or back)
Down                  # ← Back
Enter
wait:main menu again
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # (Language)
Enter                 # Quit
